    "Scan of the 1969 edition of the Denton, Michigan, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Surveyed in 1953; aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1969; photo revised in 1980; last revised in 1980; printed in 1981.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 22 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
